  "_id": "9f773ba37cb3af7b",
  "name": "Mending Mark",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "icons/consumables/potions/bottle-round-corked-red.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 3rd level, you can expend a use of your Favored Mark feature to instead place a Mending Mark on the target for 1 hour, or until you use this feature on another creature.</p>\n<p>While a creature has this mark, any creation you use on the creature that restores hit points heals an additional amount of hit points equal to one roll of your Favored Mark die.</p>\n<p>In addition, choose Strength, Dexterity, or Constitution. The creature has advantage on saving throws made with the chosen ability for the duration.</p>\n<p>Furthermore, you can cast any Marksman creation that doesn't have a range of self onto the marked creature, regardless of range.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
